{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52267","headline":"诗（幷序） 二十八 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 二十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当乡何物贵，不过五里官。\n县局南衙点，食并衆厨飡。\n文簿乡头执，余者配杂看。\n差科取高户，赋役数千般。\n处分须平等，并檑出时难。\n职任（张改作「事」）无禄料，专仰笔头钻。\n管户无五百，雷同一概看。\n愚者守直（一作「{穴/日}」，蒋谓即「冥冥」）坐，黠者馺馺看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52267.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52267","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}